 {"recommendationid": "187921698", "author": {"steamid": "76561198152747874", "personaname": "Xeno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198152747874/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1070, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1032, "last_played": 1753566496, "avatar": "0db5a1753618379d3505db7b2aea7beefaf935ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "i like the lore and game play", "timestamp_created": 1739577275, "timestamp_updated": 1739577275, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187921622", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090729864", "personaname": "Panskii11", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/panskii11/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 64886, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 247, "playtime_at_review": 8201, "last_played": 1788383494, "avatar": "8a3629a5f64d22e7a9bfa87d3da61397a20dc9d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Blood, Gore, and Brothers! AA game is better than any AAA game in the last decade. 10/10 would recommend to anyone.", "timestamp_created": 1739577195, "timestamp_updated": 1739577195, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187921153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119675169", "personaname": "Scrawl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198119675169/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 641, "last_played": 1739567687, "avatar": "2c5e2bb0147ee18200c89c7623acacd096d3472d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dissapointing.\n\nIt is a decent game, but not for the full price. The ways in which the game is uneven boggles the mind.\n\nThe visuals, designs, sounds are very good. The story, while nothing special - gets the job done and tries to balance the hero's story with the main plot.\n\nThe main problem is : shouldn't a game about a roided-out 4 meter killing machine fighting swarms of monsters be exciting?\nIt is not.\n\nThe pacing of the game is NONEXISTENT. You don't feel any sort of progression. Forget skills or perks - there are none. Stats? nope. Weapons don't give you any of that either. \n Everything tastes the same, whichever enemy you are fighting in swarms.\n\nTHE BATTLES ARE ALWAYS THE SAME LEVEL OF DIFFICULTY.\nWould it really hurt to have a moment where you are overwhelmed and as you push through right after that you reach a point where with one well placed shot you can detonate rows of exploding barrels thus killing hundreds? Or you are pitted against a couple mini bosses at once, but you get a drop from the orbit that has some super-weapon and you wipe the floor with the bad guys? \nNah, the devs decided its better to slog through room after room with waves of cannon fodder and an occasional mini boss.\nNo Escalation nor Variety.\nAlso I hoped it would be more open to exploration and finding some bonuses. But maps here are really limited.\n\n\nAnd don't get me started on the combat system. \nPlay Evil West; it's not as polished but it's definitely more fun for a third (?) of the price.", "timestamp_created": 1739576578, "timestamp_updated": 1739576578, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187919546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198426674498", "personaname": "Acute", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198426674498/", "num_games_owned": 71, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 13350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13350, "last_played": 1786608713, "avatar": "9ab6dfaa111431494d5446ba58e186ff5c667f2b"}, "language": "english", "review": "just awesome nowadays", "timestamp_created": 1739574667, "timestamp_updated": 1786794018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}]}